{"projectInfo":{"name":"BGP负载分担配置","path":"bgp_9","visibility":2,"categoryId":40,"introduction":"所有路由器都配置BGP，Router A在AS 65008中，Router B和Router C在AS 65009中。Router A与Router B、Router C之间运行EBGP，Router B和Router C之间运行IBGP。在Router A上配置负载分担的路由条数为2，以提高链路利用率。","label":["BGP","负载分担"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"RTD","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTD.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTA","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTA.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTC","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTC.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTB","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTB.cfg"}]}